# Test registry (T-182; docs/process/GATE.md "Test registry"). One line per test file in this directory or below:
#   run <file> [args]      tools/check_all.py runs `python <file> [args]` (Python tests step)
#   blender <file> <unit>  covered by that Blender unit of tools/check_all.py
#   via <file> <runner>    run by another runner (repository path)
#   local <file> <reason>  not run by the gate; the reason says why
# Adding a line for a NEW test needs no approval; changing or removing a line does.

run test_run_shot_current.py                 # T-062 cast check
run test_sets.py                             # T-098L set data
local test_clip_pipeline.py 'needs Blender; local run (not in the gate before T-182)'
local test_run_shot_workflow.py 'needs Blender; local run (not in the gate before T-182)'
